{"4754460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crystalyn", "steam_appid": 4754460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4805950, 4843610], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>About the Game</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/06883c23bd56509f3f1a9c83e3ad5c03.poster.avif?t=1787753176\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/06883c23bd56509f3f1a9c83e3ad5c03.webm?t=1787753176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/06883c23bd56509f3f1a9c83e3ad5c03.mp4?t=1787753176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Do you enjoy chaos? Unreasonable amounts of loot? Killing bosses that are 10 times as big as you?<br><br>Welcome to Crystalyn, a bullet-hell looter shooter where getting stupidly powerful is not a bug, it's the whole point.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Push your build to the limit</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/b75a0b76161ff637d1bf82961b2c00b0.poster.avif?t=1787753176\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/b75a0b76161ff637d1bf82961b2c00b0.webm?t=1787753176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/b75a0b76161ff637d1bf82961b2c00b0.mp4?t=1787753176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade a big skill tree, collect boss drops, and equip gear that turns you into a walking destruction machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There is no such thing as too many bullets. I checked.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight. Loot. Upgrade. Repeat.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/9b3cdf453f77a83a6bfb158cf06afd1a.avif?t=1787753176\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras_big/9b3cdf453f77a83a6bfb158cf06afd1a.webp?t=1787753176 width=1560 height=568 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Drop into maps with increasing difficulty, slaughter everything that moves, grab their loot, and bring it back to the lobby. Upgrade. Equip. Prestige. Go back in. Do it again. The enemies won't get a break, and you won't get bored.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Infinite ways to get stronger</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/7abf85a5088676b5da2930590a85411b.poster.avif?t=1787753176\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/7abf85a5088676b5da2930590a85411b.webm?t=1787753176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/7abf85a5088676b5da2930590a85411b.mp4?t=1787753176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade the skill tree, buy new weapons, collect better boss drops, use incantations, prestige and earn ultra powerful cards. You are only getting stronger, until the whole screen is covered in bullets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>It never stops</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/57ac1caac5d49b559e449b120b423160.avif?t=1787753176\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras_big/57ac1caac5d49b559e449b120b423160.webp?t=1787753176 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">More difficulty settings, more maps, more chaos. The game does not slow down. Neither should you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>About the Game</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/06883c23bd56509f3f1a9c83e3ad5c03.poster.avif?t=1787753176\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/06883c23bd56509f3f1a9c83e3ad5c03.webm?t=1787753176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/06883c23bd56509f3f1a9c83e3ad5c03.mp4?t=1787753176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Do you enjoy chaos? Unreasonable amounts of loot? Killing bosses that are 10 times as big as you?<br><br>Welcome to Crystalyn, a bullet-hell looter shooter where getting stupidly powerful is not a bug, it's the whole point.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Push your build to the limit</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/b75a0b76161ff637d1bf82961b2c00b0.poster.avif?t=1787753176\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/b75a0